---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../config/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description={`Content disclaimer for ${SITE_NAME} planning guides and calculators.`}
  path="/disclaimer"
>
  <p>
    Calculators and articles on {SITE_NAME} provide <strong>planning estimates only</strong>. They help
    homeowners and DIYers think through material quantities, waste allowance, and related conversions.
  </p>
  <p>
    They are not structural engineering, building-code approval, electrical or plumbing design,
    architectural plans, product testing, real-time pricing, or professional contractor estimates.
    Local codes, permits, HOA rules, climate, substrate conditions, and manufacturer instructions may
    change what your project requires.
  </p>
  <p>
    Confirm measurements on site, read the label on products you purchase, and consult a qualified
    professional when a project involves structural, electrical, plumbing, or other safety-critical
    decisions.
  </p>
  <p>
    See also <a href="/about/how-we-create-content">How We Create Content</a> and
    <a href="/about">About {SITE_NAME}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
